  The file web/src/data/trivia-snapshot.json is a snapshot of questions from
  Open Trivia DB, bundled offline. It was built by
  web/scripts/build-trivia-snapshot.mjs: the text is HTML-decoded, and
  flagged, offensive, duplicate and time-sensitive ("dated") questions are
  removed. Categories and difficulties are balanced. The snapshot's
  attribution and licence fields are recorded in the file itself.

  Because the snapshot is adapted from CC BY-SA 4.0 material, any edited or
  redistributed question set stays under CC BY-SA 4.0, with attribution to
  Open Trivia DB and a link to the licence.
